	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "TI TPS23730RMTR, VQFN-45 RMT package (7.0x5.0mm, 0.4mm pitch, DUAL exposed pad). GEOMETRY REPLACED Task 14b: land pattern taken from the LCSC/EasyEDA footprint for TPS23731RMTR C3189532 (identical TI RMT0045A package) and cross-verified dimension-by-dimension against TI's own RMT0045A package outline / example board layout in the TPS23730 datasheet (SLVSF66, pkg drawing 4225180/A): pin distribution left 1-13 / bottom 14-22 (9 pads, x=-1.8..+1.4) / right 23-35 / top 36-45 (10 pads, x=+1.8..-1.8), columns at x=+/-2.4, 0.4mm pitch with 0.8mm double-gaps between pins 9/10 (left, y=+0.6/+1.4) and 29/30 (right, y=+0.2/-0.6), pads 0.2x0.6mm, PAD_G/PAD_S dual EPs: pad 46 = 3.7x2.1 at y=-1.4, pad 47 = 2.9x2.15 at y=+1.37 -- all eight checked values match the TI drawing exactly. Prior Task-14 approximation had the per-side pin distribution wrong (10/12/10/13 vs real 13/9/13/10) and guessed EP geometry. 3D model: TPS23731 EasyEDA body (same RMT package).")
